{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54579","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大（京本作「青」）黄雾，腾{曰/卓}（京本作「胜气」）掩山川。\n乍合乍开防诈僞，须防内外有（京本作「与外」）相连，不悟血侵（京本作「浸」）田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}